{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a miracle of modern science ended in global catastrophe. The <strong>Dead Fiber Virus</strong> was first dismissed as a lab accident\u2014until it spread faster than containment efforts could follow. Entire cities fell within days. Governments pointed fingers, calling it <strong>biological warfare</strong>, and soon nations turned their weapons on each other. Nuclear fire finished what the virus began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the world lies in ruins\u2014charred cities crawling with <strong>Fiber-infected</strong>, the dead whose nervous systems have been hijacked by the virus\u2019s synthetic tendrils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this broken world, survival has a price. You play as a <strong>mercenary</strong>, taking on high-risk missions in zones overrun by the infected\u2014retrieving data, rescuing survivors, and hunting for lost technology. You don\u2019t fight for ideals. You fight for <strong>pay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No area is too deadly, no job too impossible\u2014<strong>as long as the money\u2019s right</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a sandbox action/horror experience where survival is paramount. Navigate through stunning and diverse locations while mastering stealth, utilizing a variety of melee and ranged weapons, gadgets, and grenade types.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834670?t=1772076400","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772076400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772076400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772076400","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4109920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a miracle of modern science ended in global catastrophe. The <strong>Dead Fiber Virus</strong> was first dismissed as a lab accident\u2014until it spread faster than containment efforts could follow. Entire cities fell within days. Governments pointed fingers, calling it <strong>biological warfare</strong>, and soon nations turned their weapons on each other. Nuclear fire finished what the virus began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the world lies in ruins\u2014charred cities crawling with <strong>Fiber-infected</strong>, the dead whose nervous systems have been hijacked by the virus\u2019s synthetic tendrils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this broken world, survival has a price. You play as a <strong>mercenary</strong>, taking on high-risk missions in zones overrun by the infected\u2014retrieving data, rescuing survivors, and hunting for lost technology. You don\u2019t fight for ideals. You fight for <strong>pay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No area is too deadly, no job too impossible\u2014<strong>as long as the money\u2019s right</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a sandbox action/horror experience where survival is paramount. Navigate through stunning and diverse locations while mastering stealth, utilizing a variety of melee and ranged weapons, gadgets, and grenade types.</p>","developers":["UAVision"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834670/header.jpg?t=1772076400","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</st